cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use HebOCRBench, cite this software release and every corpus source present in your materialized build."
title: "HebOCRBench: Unicode-, BiDi-, Layout- and Diacritic-Aware OCR Benchmark for Hebrew-Script Documents"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-07-23
license: MIT
authors:
  - name: "HebOCRBench contributors"
keywords:
  - OCR
  - Hebrew
  - Yiddish
  - Unicode
  - bidirectional text
  - document layout analysis
  - handwritten text recognition
abstract: >-
  HebOCRBench is a reproducible benchmark suite for Hebrew-script OCR. It evaluates
  Unicode logical order, mixed bidirectional text, diacritics, punctuation, layout,
  reading order, tables and forms, and provides a license-aware federated pipeline
  for materializing and certifying real PAGE XML and ALTO corpora.
